{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200c<strong>Lenscraft Cube</strong>\u200c is a minimalist platformer puzzle game. In this game, you play as a small cube, starting with boundary-designed mechanisms to solve puzzles. Each mechanism in the game is simple and easy to understand, allowing you to fully utilize your imagination to find the path to the destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200c<strong>Game Features:</strong>\u200c</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Minimalist Aesthetics</i>: Build challenging puzzle worlds with simple geometric shapes, where each scene is simple yet beautiful</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Boundary Puzzles</i>: Unique &quot;Camera View&quot; mechanism that manipulates objects or changes gravity direction by adjusting perspective</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Progressive Difficulty</i>: From basic jumps to compound mechanisms, 100+ levels with gradually increasing difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Workshop</i>: Supports Steam Workshop for custom level creation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856340/extras/e6a16f6e3cc5996181ab8dcc25ef9be7.poster.avif?t=1761702032\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856340/extras/e6a16f6e3cc5996181ab8dcc25ef9be7.webm?t=1761702032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856340/extras/e6a16f6e3cc5996181ab8dcc25ef9be7.mp4?t=1761702032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856340/extras/e6a16f6e3cc5996181ab8dcc25ef9be7.poster.a